Card details: rulings now start collapsed, so you can show a player the Oracle text without them; tap "Show rulings" to open them. Official and community formats are listed apart, and your custom lists show what they say about the card. Card Search no longer says "0 cards found" before it has searched. Restricted has its own color everywhere, and Deck Counter and HJ Announcement use the same option control as the rest of the app, which now fits large text sizes.
